        "61. 小数的乘法"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "问题1. 长方形长0.5分米，宽0.3分米。求这个长方形",
        "的面积。"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "我们用厘米来表示长方形的长和宽。0.5分米=5厘米；",
        "0.3分米=3厘米。这个长方形的面积是$5\\cdot3=15$（平方厘米）。"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "由于1平方分米=100平方厘米，故1平方厘米=$\\frac{1}{100}$平方分",
        "米，而15平方厘米=$\\frac{15}{100}$平方分米=0.15平方分米（图VII）。"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": true,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "如果长方形的长和宽是自然数，那么它的面积就等于长",
        "与宽的积。因此，0.15也叫做0.5与0.3的积，写成："
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "foot",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "215"
      ]
    }
  ]
